+// Whether to re-anchor mpv's audio clock with a small read. After the lead
+// is filled no pulls happen, and mpv extrapolates its clock as if audio had
+// started at the last one; a parked AirPlay clock then leaves video seconds
+// ahead until the lead next drains. A read while the clock is parked
+// reports the true, still-zero playhead again.
+static bool avp_should_anchor(bool enabled, bool rate_applied, bool eof,
+                              int64_t clock, int64_t fed, int64_t start_lead,
+                              int64_t since_anchor)
